      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Nimble Dodge",
      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "defensive",
      "text": "Trigger A creature targets the ruthless fetchling sneak with an attack and they can see the attacker.\n\nRequirements The sneak is not encumbered\n\n---\n\nThe ruthless fetchling sneak deftly dodges out of the way, gaining a +2 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack.",
      "rules": [
